{"c":[{"name":"20261023T185340Z-f0241d50f37fdbf8","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: user-facing docs describe the system as it is. History gets its own section or is omitted. Make tables are indexes. Critical procedures are short numbered STE100 steps.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T192936Z-7fa70422db429591","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: architecture states migration cutoffs and the schema snapshot, not filenames or schema versions. Contributing schema-docs says the diagram is generated and which sources to edit.","type":"note"}]}
